abstract: "NovelCraft is an open-source, full-stack AI storytelling engine that synthesizes premise inputs into structured, chapter-by-chapter novel outlines with dramatic act pacing (Three-Act / Hero's Journey) using distributed LLM chaining and QLoRA fine-tuning."
